	"identifying_description": "Woman's ensemble consisting of jacket, blouse, skirt, and fabric: (a) jacket of synthetic beige fabric with gold supplementary weft patterning with collar, cartridge pleated neckline, curved lapels, and peasant-style sleeves; single button closure at front neck. Label at back of neck: “Geoffrey/ Beene”; (b) blouse of dark beige silk crepe with collar and four button closure at front; single button closure at each wrist; trimmed with metallic braid at collar, front button placket, and wrists. Label at back of neck: “Geoffrey/ Beene”; (d) synthetic beige fabric with gold supplementary weft patterning from skirt hem.",
